        Source V4404 = Swedish extension of V44.0 (driver nontraffic collision with heavy transport
        vehicle/bus) plus activity qualifier vitalaktivitet (vital activity: rest/sleep/meal/personal
        hygiene). Base V44.0 maps to SNOMED CT 437738 (Motor vehicle accident off public road) and 444074
